1
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:22,680
So, Jostra-san, you don't know
where Jotaro is right now?

2
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:24,761
I can't feel his presence at all.

3
00:05:25,180 --> 00:05:27,533
Polnareff and Iggy, I hope they're safe.

4
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:29,440
So then, do you think...

5
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:34,760
Even if we're the only ones left
standing, we've got to defeat Dio.

6
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:38,500
Kakyoin, how are your eyes?

7
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:41,284
Yes, I'm doing much better now.

8
00:05:41,460 --> 00:05:43,297
Sorry for the trouble I put you through.

9
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:47,440
But I'm ready now to fight Dio to
the fullest extent of my power.

10
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,400
Be vigilant, Kakyoin.

11
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,824
Even Avdol was taken out
in the blink of an eye.

12
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:57,057
Even though we encountered
Dio's stand, the world,

13
00:05:57,140 --> 00:06:00,137
we weren't able to actually
see its abilities at all.

14
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:01,780
There has to be something.

15
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,900
Some way to fight Dio.

16
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,700
Dio is after us.

17
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:11,717
Yes, he'll be coming after my
Joestar blood, that's for certain.

18
