Back when I was born, there were
only horse carriages around.

24
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,180
Ah, this really sucks.

25
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:40,140
Is this car still working?

26
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:43,060
And just who the hell are you?

27
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:46,710
You?

28
00:07:46,793 --> 00:07:47,940
You didn't get hurt?

29
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:53,657
I'm asking you if this
car is still working?

30
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:59,137
Hey hold on if you're not
hurt then just get lost!

31
00:07:59,220 --> 00:08:04,017
And another thing keep your damn
hands off the car buddy or maybe

32
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:07,982
you bumped into it On purpose
knowing that it's the senator's car?

33
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:25,077
Oh, you young people seem to
act on your impulses too easily.

34
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:28,454
Well, in any case, I apologize
for my driver's behavior.

35
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:31,140
And I hope you didn't get hurt.

36
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,480
Start the car.

37
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:35,640
We can't.

38
00:08:35,740 --> 00:08:37,269
You knocked out my driver.

39
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:40,637
Well, if you're in a hurry,
and I don't mean to offend you,

40
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:43,132
please take this and you can hail a taxi.

41
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,400
Shut up and drive.

42
00:08:52,220 --> 00:08:55,120
What in God's name do
you think you're doing?

43
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:58,127
Do you have any idea
who you're dealing with?

44
00:08:58,420 --> 00:09:00,720
It's the small red pickup truck ahead.

45
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:02,611
Drive until you catch up.

46
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:03,770
Huh?

47
00:09:03,853 --> 00:09:04,683
You're crazy.

48
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:07,117
You can't imagine you're actually
going to get away with this.

49
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:10,494
I'm a center of the United
States of America, goddammit!

50
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:18,660
If we don't catch up, you're dead.

51
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:24,000
You're insane!

52
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:25,800
I'll execute you!

53
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,820
I'll have you executed for this!

54
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:42,260
What the hell?!

55
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,508
Hurry up and start the car.

56
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,680
Somebody help me!

57
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:57,520
You'd better hurry up,
while you're still alive.

58
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,699
Tch, must have broke a few of them.

59
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:18,100
But I'm lucky to be alive,

60
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:22,869
even though I have no idea how I managed
to survive Dio's point-blank attack.

61
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:27,380
Just what is his stand, anyway?

62
00:10:27,740 --> 00:10:30,657
I've heard the tarot card
representing it is the world.

63
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:33,681
I couldn't even see his
stand, let alone study it.

64
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,860
But I did figure out one thing.

65
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,470
Dio.

66
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:49,300
I hate to admit it,

67
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:52,437
but the speed and power
of your stand and my

68
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:55,285
Star Platinum look to be
pretty evenly matched.

69
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,740
Still, there's something else.

70
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,904
Some kind of incredible secret.

71
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:05,438
He's way more intimidating than any
of the other stand users I've met.

72
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:10,420
It's no wonder N'Doul and Iced
pledge their undying loyalty to Dio.

73
00:11:14,140 --> 00:11:17,900
I guess you're bad-assed enough
to be my opponent, all right.

74
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,040
Hurry it up.

75
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:24,697
If you just take a look around,

76
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:28,160
I'm sure you'll understand
that the traffic is very bad.

77
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:30,040
It's not moving at all.

78
00:11:31,180 --> 00:11:33,239
There's some space on the sidewalk.

79
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:37,640
You can't be serious.

80
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,720
What about my reputation?

81
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,380
