82
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:46,120
It doesn't matter. Go.

83
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,860
You need to go faster.

84
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,880
Yes, sir.

85
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,430
Faster.

86
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,780
Yes, sir.

87
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:20,300
Dio, please stop this.

88
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,180
I don't think so.

89
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,980
He's coming, Kakyoin.

90
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:31,700
