exudes is closing in on us.

91
00:12:31,900 --> 00:12:33,160
But where is he?

92
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:38,442
Hmm, I can feel his existence through the
sensations in the Joestar blood we share.

93
00:12:38,620 --> 00:12:41,796
