106
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,700
It's Kakyoin's Hierophant.

107
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:02,840
He evaded Emerald Splash
at such close range?

108
00:14:03,060 --> 00:14:04,001
All right, then.

109
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:20,657
Shit, didn't even graze him.

110
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:22,237
I'll concentrate it more this time.

111
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,908
Don't get too close to him.

112
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:29,077
Kakyoin, retreat for now.

113
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:30,777
We can't fight without a strategy.

114
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,097
I'll just try to lose him.

115
00:14:32,180 --> 00:14:35,277
But Chostar-san, we haven't figured
out anything about his stand.

116
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,190
No!

117
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:40,050
Kakyoin!

118
00:14:40,133 --> 00:14:40,963
Back off!

119
00:14:41,046 --> 00:14:41,876
Retreat!

120
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:49,340
Kakyoin! Behind you!

121
00:15:15,140 --> 00:15:15,970
I don't know.

122
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:47,479
We bought ourselves some
time to work on a strategy.

123
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:49,326
Kakyoin, how are your wounds?

124
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:50,580
I'm sorry.

125
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,311
I lost control of myself.

126
00:15:53,620 --> 00:15:57,220
But I was able to figure out
a couple things. About Dio?

127
00:15:57,480 --> 00:16:00,920
The world is similar to
Jotaro's Star Platinum.

128
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:04,777
It doesn't seem to possess
any projectile weapons,

129
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:07,137
