I think that could work to our advantage.

131
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:13,180
We get beaten before we even
realize what's going on. Why?

132
00:16:13,420 --> 00:16:16,302
For us not to sense his
presence when he appears.

133
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:18,126
Suddenly appearing like that?

134
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:20,733
What kind of secret power could that be?

135
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:25,817
Is it possible for his stand to possess
some sort of teleportation abilities?

136
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:28,177
If so, that would explain
why he's able to...

137
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:30,140
Kakyoin, that's not like you.

138
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:33,080
A hasty conclusion could
cost you your life.

139
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:37,137
You can't be too careful when dealing
with someone as powerful as Dio.

140
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:38,050
Hm?

141
00:16:38,133 --> 00:16:39,600
What the...?

142
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:41,050
Kakyoin!

143
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:25,730
Dio!

144
00:17:25,813 --> 00:17:28,337
How can he involve
innocent people in this?

145
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:31,060
Is something the matter, Kakyoin? Huh?

146
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,540
I have an idea.

147
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:38,740
A way to reveal the true
nature of Dio's stand.

148
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:39,908
Hmm, there's no use trying.

149
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:54,300
Hmm, I don't see Kakyoin around.

150
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:56,953
Are they going to attack from two sides?

151
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:07,060
Damn, it's Kakyoin's Hierophant!

152
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:17,280
A barrier created by Hierophant!

153
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:19,760
How clever of you!

154
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:31,890
What is this?

155
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,740
There you go, Dio.

156
00:19:40,980 --> 00:19:42,568
How do you like my barrier?

157
00:19:43,580 --> 00:19:46,462
The Hierophant's barrier
fires back when touched.

158
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:48,894
Surrounds you in a radius of 20 meters.

159
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:52,120
I can detect every single
move that you make.

160
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:53,940
Same goes for your stand.

161
00:19:54,520 --> 00:19:56,280
We've got you now, Dio.

162
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:59,460
Show it to us.

163
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:01,300
The world's secret.

164
00:20:04,100 --> 00:20:07,860
Kakyoin, your first name
is Noriyaki, isn't it?

165
00:20:08,180 --> 00:20:10,680
How old are you now? What?

166
00:20:12,040 --> 00:20:15,060
Why would someone so young
wish to hurry his death?

167
00:20:16,620 --> 00:20:20,997
I'm afraid you don't understand the severity
of the situation you're in now, Dio.

168
00:20:21,080 --> 00:20:24,620
No matter what kind of
power the world possesses,

169
00:20:24,740 --> 00:20:27,093
