170
00:20:27,500 --> 00:20:29,380
Do you really believe that?

171
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,880
Try it, then.

172
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:36,400
Are you frightened of
me, Noriyaki Kakyoin?

173
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:40,120
Just like you were last year. No way!

174
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:44,700
Yes, it's true that I gave in to
nauseating fear when I first met you.

175
00:20:45,020 --> 00:20:46,440
But no longer!

176
00:20:47,800 --> 00:20:51,377
Kakyoin, you are a thoughtful
and excellent stand user.

177
00:20:51,460 --> 00:20:53,377
Such unusual qualities?

178
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:55,877
What worth do you see in protecting and

179
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:58,842
sacrificing your life for
an old man like Joseph?

180
00:20:59,020 --> 00:21:01,397
While Jotaro and Joseph-san did save me.

181
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:03,937
That's only part of the
reason I fight with them now!

182
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:08,377
I've been fighting to regain my honor after
all the indignities I suffered from you.

183
00:21:08,460 --> 00:21:09,977
It is not too late yet!

184
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:12,657
Pledge eternal loyalty and you will live.

185
00:21:12,740 --> 00:21:14,257
Here is my answer?

186
00:21:14,340 --> 00:21:15,300
Deal!

187
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:18,680
You fool!

188
00:21:25,620 --> 00:21:26,580
Very well.

189
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:31,075
Witness now my stand, which has the
power to rule this world completely.

190
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,480
The world!

191
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:57,040
My stand is the world, you see.

192
00:22:02,020 --> 00:22:02,850
Although,

193
00:22:03,020 --> 00:22:07,780
in the stillness of time, you are not
able to see nor feel anything at all.

194
00:22:10,260 --> 00:22:11,460
Die, Kakyoin!

195
00:22:20,380 --> 00:22:23,380
You don't even know that
your death is now assured.

196
00:22:23,580 --> 00:22:26,227
There's no way for you
to know what happened.

197
00:22:29,500 --> 00:22:30,980
You're next, old man.

198
00:22:43,720 --> 00:22:45,600
At last, Joseph.

199
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,136
Just you and me now.

200
00:22:49,140 --> 00:22:49,970
Dio.

201
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:55,897
What happened?

202
00:22:55,980 --> 00:22:58,460
Did Dio do this? But...

203
00:23:01,800 --> 00:23:03,320
I can't move.

204
00:23:09,720 --> 00:23:11,880
Is it seven o 'clock now?

205
00:23:12,480 --> 00:23:14,640
Must be midnight in Japan.

206
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:17,140
Father. Mother.

207
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:18,420
I'm sorry.

208
00:23:18,900 --> 00:23:22,080
It seems my time is running out.

209
00:23:22,580 --> 00:23:25,220
This has been a short life.

210
00:23:26,020 --> 00:23:28,637
But thanks to Jotaro and the others,

211
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:32,340
I can die knowing that I
didn't give in to my fear.

212
00:23:33,360 --> 00:23:39,320
Although I was no match for Dio's
power, I lived my life as I wanted.

213
00:23:39,700 --> 00:23:42,120
I have no regrets but one.

214
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:45,620
Joestar-san, I'm sorry.

215
00:23:45,980 --> 00:23:51,660
I wasn't able to defeat Dio, nor
find the secrets to Dio's stand.

216
00:23:53,480 --> 00:24:00,177
but why why was a perfect barrier broken

217
00:24:00,260 --> 00:24:03,937
all at once i saw

218
00:24:04,020 --> 00:24:07,617
every move despite that

219
00:24:07,700 --> 00:24:11,857
not just one part but
the entire barrier of

220
00:24:11,940 --> 00:24:16,160
20 meters at once why without any time lag

221
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:22,340
without any time lag

222
00:24:26,020 --> 00:24:26,850
time

223
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:31,877
that must be it it's the
only thing I can think

224
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:38,377
of time he can stop time
I must let him know this

225
00:24:38,460 --> 00:24:42,097
shocking truth somehow I
must let Jostar-san know

226
00:24:42,180 --> 00:24:47,200
otherwise Jostar-san's And
Holly-san's lives will be...

227
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,900
Don't you agree, Joseph?

228
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:54,337
The best way to melt my
head onto Jonathan Joestar's

229
00:24:54,420 --> 00:24:57,360
body is to use the blood
of his closest relative.

230
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:06,586
Joseph Joestar, I'm letting you know that
I will kill you by sucking your blood.

231
00:25:08,500 --> 00:25:12,840
Before it adapts, I'll cut you in
half right through that scar of yours!

232
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:18,376
That bloodline of yours that speaks
too boldly is now coming to an end.

233
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:20,140
Now you die!

234
00:25:35,340 --> 00:25:36,170
Last...

235
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:40,257
He's shooting in such a random direction.

236
00:25:40,340 --> 00:25:43,281
It could well be the
exertion of his last moments.

237
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:45,217
That can't be.

238
00:25:45,300 --> 00:25:49,177
Kakyoin is not the kind of man to do
something pointless at a time like this.

239
00:25:49,260 --> 00:25:51,120
But why that clock tower?

240
00:25:51,700 --> 00:25:53,740
Message from me.

241
00:25:54,740 --> 00:25:56,780
This is all I can do.

242
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:03,640
Joestar-san, please, accept it.

243
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:07,710
Kakyoin!

244
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,070
Dio!

245
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:17,640
Take this!

246
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:25,520
You old man, your stand is
the most pathetic of them all!

247
00:26:34,120 --> 00:26:36,649
There must be some
important meaning to it.

248
00:26:38,140 --> 00:26:41,980
Kakyoin, what was it you tried
to tell me with the clock tower?

249
00:26:42,780 --> 00:26:46,721
Destroying the clock tower like
that, what's the meaning of it all?

250
00:26:47,740 --> 00:26:50,220
It's no use trying to escape, Joseph.

251
00:26:52,060 --> 00:26:55,120
Could it be Dio's The World Secret?

252
00:26:57,880 --> 00:27:00,140
But to destroy the clock!

253
00:27:00,500 --> 00:27:02,200
To stop the clock!

254
00:27:08,220 --> 00:27:09,050
Ha!

255
00:27:09,133 --> 00:27:10,220
Stopping the clock!

256
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:17,470
Impossible.

257
00:27:17,660 --> 00:27:19,940
He's saying the world can stop time?

258
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:23,820
I understand now, Kakyoin.

259
00:27:24,080 --> 00:27:28,960
The message you sent me with your last
ounce of strength, I have received it.

260
00:27:35,020 --> 00:27:35,850
What?

261
00:27:43,060 --> 00:27:46,001
Hmph, you are quite a
schemer, aren't you, Joseph?

262
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:52,740
The same could be said about you.

263
00:27:53,080 --> 00:27:56,260
So, you noticed my wave
energy shield, huh?

264
00:27:56,540 --> 00:27:59,380
Well, I know something about you, too.

265
00:27:59,820 --> 00:28:02,277
For you to come after
us like this must mean

266
00:28:02,360 --> 00:28:05,125
that your ability to stop
time is very limited.

267
00:28:06,140 --> 00:28:07,700
Isn't that right, Dio?

268
00:28:09,260 --> 00:28:11,600
Well, you managed to figure it out.

269
00:28:11,900 --> 00:28:13,841
I have to compliment you on that.

270
00:28:14,120 --> 00:28:16,296
The one to figure it out was Kakyoin.

271
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,780
He did not die in vain.

272
00:28:18,120 --> 00:28:19,414
So you figured it out.

273
00:28:19,520 --> 00:28:20,350
Big deal.

274
00:28:20,433 --> 00:28:22,577
There's nothing you're going
to be able to do about it.

275
00:28:22,660 --> 00:28:25,080
Your wave energy means nothing to me.

276
00:29:03,180 --> 00:29:04,580
Jotaro, stay back!

277
00:29:04,780 --> 00:29:05,857
Don't come near me!

278
00:29:05,940 --> 00:29:06,770
It's Jotaro.

279
00:29:06,853 --> 00:29:09,180
Just as I suspected, he's still alive.

280
00:29:09,360 --> 00:29:11,654
But he is out of the range of my stand.

281
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:13,967
I'll deal with Joseph first.

282
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:17,880
Jotaro, the true nature
of the world is time.

283
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:20,840
Dio's stand can stop time.

284
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:38,334
In the beginning, my power was only
able to stop time for a split second.

285
00:29:39,500 --> 00:29:41,637
But as the scar on my neck is fading,

286
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:44,560
the time frame has increased
up to five seconds.

287
00:29:46,920 --> 00:29:52,420
Soon, I will be able to stop
time for as long as I may desire.

288
00:29:59,180 --> 00:30:03,160
Guarding yourself with wave energy
won't do you any good, Joseph.

289
00:30:03,860 --> 00:30:07,317
A hundred years ago, the wave
energy was a slight problem for me.

290
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:11,060
But now with the power of the
world, it's insignificant.

291
00:30:11,740 --> 00:30:14,657
Jonathan's grandson Joseph.

292
00:30:14,740 --> 00:30:17,860
Your life has come to an end.

293
00:30:24,540 --> 00:30:26,937
Three seconds. Two.

294
00:30:27,020 --> 00:30:28,660
One. Zero.

295
00:30:41,580 --> 00:30:43,500
Old man...

296
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:49,440
Jotaro!

297
00:30:50,580 --> 00:30:52,400
Don't go near him.

298
00:30:52,580 --> 00:30:54,120
Keep your distance.

299
00:30:54,900 --> 00:30:57,360
You're no match for him.

300
00:31:03,060 --> 00:31:06,040
I've already finished
off your friend, Kakyoin.

301
00:31:08,740 --> 00:31:11,040
Jotaro, you're the last one.

302
00:31:15,100 --> 00:31:17,680
You bastard, Dio.

303
00:31:21,040 --> 00:31:23,840
Oh, are you coming for me?

304
00:31:24,460 --> 00:31:27,140
You're not obeying your late grandfather.

305
00:31:27,560 --> 00:31:30,480
You're coming very close to Dio.

306
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:33,940
Yeah, gotta get closer.

307
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:37,040
to mess you up.

308
00:32:09,840 --> 00:32:11,240
Vincere

309
00:32:18,100 --> 00:32:20,720
Vincere Vincere

310
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:31,480
Vincere

311
00:32:40,940 --> 00:32:43,060
And I love you in the shadow?

312
00:33:08,740 --> 00:33:10,140
Thank you.

313
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:34,510
Thank you.

314
00:34:05,880 --> 00:34:07,280
Thank you.

315
00:34:31,680 --> 00:34:36,740
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

316
00:35:04,620 --> 00:35:06,020
Thank you.
